\newlabel{tab:control}{{IV}{8}{Neutral re-examination control versus the two production arms on the triple-paired incorrect stratum (ground truth assigned, parsed verdict from all three arms; $n_{T=0}$ is its size per family). $\hat \kappa $ is false acceptance in percent; the token ratio is realized mean control-versus-steelman completion tokens; $b/c$ counts discordant incorrect candidates (control accepts, steelman rejects versus the reverse); $p$ is the exact McNemar value for the control-versus-steelman contrast}{table.4}{}}
